  <Docs>
    <summary>Indicates whether a ranging technology is available and, if not, why it is unavailable.</summary>
    <remarks>The status distinguishes an unsupported technology from one disabled by the user, regulation, or device usage restrictions. <see cref="F:Android.Ranging.RangingCapabilitiesStatus.Enabled" /> indicates that the technology is available for use.</remarks>
  </Docs>
